          </div>

          <p class="hero-description" id="hero-bio">
            BCA 2nd Year undergraduate at <strong>Shri Ram Group of College, Muzaffarnagar (Delhi NCR)</strong> with a strong <strong>8.36 CGPA</strong>. Deeply focused on <strong>Software Engineering</strong>, <strong>Power BI Data Analytics</strong>, <strong>SQL & DBMS</strong>, and programming in <strong>Python, C/C++, and Java</strong>.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="https://wa.me/919263635699?text=Hello%20Nishu,%20I%20viewed%20your%20portfolio!" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-whatsapp" id="hero-whatsapp-btn">
